# The webview library asks pkg-config for webkit2gtk-4.0, which newer distributions no
# longer ship. WebKitGTK 4.1 has the same API apart from libsoup, which webview does not
# use, so this file lets it build against 4.1. Put this folder first in PKG_CONFIG_PATH.
Name: webkit2gtk-4.0
Description: WebKitGTK 4.1 under the name the webview library expects
Version: 2.40.0
Requires: webkit2gtk-4.1 gtk+-3.0
